								<div id="contentForThisGame_ctn">
				</div>
									<div data-panel="{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;PanelGroup&quot;}" id="aboutThisGame" class="game_page_autocollapse" style="max-height: 850px;">
						<div id="game_area_description" class="game_area_description">
							<h2>About This Game</h2>
							<p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin="anonymous" poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4191350/extras/6d2766ee5c454c62ba50d180b65e2871.poster.avif?t=1791069519" width=948 height=394 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4191350/extras/6d2766ee5c454c62ba50d180b65e2871.webm?t=1791069519" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"></video></span></p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Tales of Fear is a first-person horror adventure featuring playable retellings of various horror stories. Some of them are fictional, while others are based on real events, and it's up to you to figure out which ones are true.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Take on the role of the protagonist in each narrative and experience unique stories. Explore immersive, handcrafted locations on your own and encounter some frightening surprises along the way.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><h2 class="bb_tag" ><strong>Case 01 - Enfield Encounter</strong></h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >Patrick McKelvy's relaxed evening turns out to be a dangerous nightmare that he is forced to endure while fearing for his life. He encounters a creature that does not exist in any history book and causes great chaos in his city.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><h2 class="bb_tag" ><strong>Case 02 - Alice and Bob</strong></h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >An employee of a large tech company takes on a night shift with his colleague that will haunt him for a long time afterward. An experiment in artificial intelligence is supposed to take the company to the next level. When his coworker suddenly has an emergency, he is left alone with the experiment. It goes well, too well, until he loses control of the AI models.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><h2 class="bb_tag" ><strong>Case 03 - Doai Station</strong></h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >Kaito, a freelance journalist chasing a rumor at Mount Tanigawa, decides to take the last train home. As the train arrives, he is on the phone with his brother, Haru, when the connection suddenly breaks. While waiting for Kaito's arrival, Haru becomes anxious, only to find out that the last train from Doai Station had already left hours before the phone call.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><h2 class="bb_tag" ><strong>Key features</strong></h2><ul class="bb_ul"><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Three playable cases with unique atmospheres</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Recreation of real locations</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Dynamic audio system</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Various tasks and mini-puzzles</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Guess which stories are true and compare your answers with other players</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Interactive dialogues</p></li></ul>						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="game_page_autocollapse">
		<div id="game_area_content_descriptors" class="game_area_description">
			<h2>AI Generated Content Disclosure</h2>
			<p>The developers describe how their game uses AI Generated Content like this:</p>
			<p><i>
					We used a mix of real voice actors and AI-generated voices.				</i>
			</p>
					</div>
	</div>
